Update the test to reflect the new turn budget: change that sub-case to assert that a repeated tool ID is rejected *when the turn budget allows a second turn* — i.e. pass explicit limits `{ maxTurns: 4 }`. That keeps the reuse-detection contract tested while honoring the new default:

```js
